    {
      "source": "Resolve all alias target names and aliases registered in this\nregistry, applying the given <a href=\"../util/StringValueResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>StringValueResolver</code></a> to them.",
      "translation": "解析此注册表中注册的所有别名目标名称和别名，并将给定的<a href=\"../util/StringValueResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>StringValueResolver</code></a>应用于它们。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Logger available to subclasses.",
      "translation": "可供子类使用的 Logger。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine the raw name, resolving aliases to canonical names.",
      "translation": "确定原始名称，将别名解析为规范名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Check whether the given name points back to the given alias as an alias\nin the other direction already, catching a circular reference upfront\nand throwing a corresponding IllegalStateException.",
      "translation": "检查给定名称是否已在相反方向作为别名指向给定的别名，从而提前捕获循环引用并抛出相应的 `IllegalStateException`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the aliases for the given name, if defined.",
      "translation": "如果已定义，则返回给定名称的别名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether the given name has the given alias registered.",
      "translation": "确定给定的名称是否已注册了给定的别名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether the given name is defined as an alias\n(as opposed to the name of an actually registered component).",
